+ install string-yes@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin install string-yes@thismoon --scope user
- disable zero@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin disable zero@thismoon --scope user
- uninstall retired-zero@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin uninstall retired-zero@thismoon --scope user
